If you must carry the tinning kit, keep it in your bag (they're pretty
heavy).  If you have all the resistances and 18/** STR, though, you
don't really need it as long as you watch out for gremlins.  It's also
a good idea to keep a couple of holy waters in a sack, to uncurse the
BoH as needed.

