Disenchanters are a pain.  If you're not going to genocide them, try to
locate them with telepathy and kill them from a distance.

> How do I deal with all the traps in Gehennom?? I though levitation
> would work, but apparently they still go off. I REALLY don't want to
> destroy my robe setting off a random poly trap.

Erodeproof all your armor, keep your potions and scrolls in bags, and
just don't worry about them.

> Any advice?? I figure I probably won't ascend, sine this is my first
> time so deep, but I sure wanna get as far as possible.

You might.  You're already over the hump.

> What am I missing before I venture deeper???

Potions of full healing and cursed scrolls of teleport.  If you can get
a magic marker, enchant up your armor better too.

Basically, if you can get your HP up to around 300 (with alchemy), your
AC down to -35ish (with donations and scrolls), and erodeproof all your
armor (with scrolls), there's very little in Gehennom that poses a real
threat.  By the time you reach the Wizard, hopefully you'll have one or
two wands of death for him.

Oh, and watch out for Demogorgon.  If you see him, save the game and go
read his spoiler before proceeding.



